# agent-tooling artifacts, not part of the app
web/.manus-logs/
web/client/public/__manus__/
# Review patches dropped in the worktree ROOT only. Must NOT be a bare
# *.patch glob: web/patches/ holds pnpm dependency patches, which are
# build inputs. Those are tracked, so a bare glob does not remove them
# -- it silently drops the NEXT one `pnpm patch-commit` writes, and the
# build then differs between machines with nothing in git status to say so.
/*.patch
